'''Gor Koresh's Honky Tonk''', also known as the '''Carnita arena''',<ref name="Art of Mando 2">[[The Art of Star Wars: The Mandalorian (Season Two)|''The Art of Star Wars: The Mandalorian'' Season Two]]</ref> was an arena owned by the [[Abyssin]] [[gangster]] [[Gor Koresh]], which he used to profit from [[gladiator]] matches.<ref name="Encyclopedia">''[[Star Wars: Character Encyclopedia, Updated and Expanded Edition]]''</ref> In [[9 ABY]],<ref name="Date">The events of "[[Chapter 9: The Marshal]]" took place in [[9 ABY]] per the reasoning [[Template:MandoDate|here]].</ref> the [[Mandalorian]] [[bounty hunter]] [[Din Djarin]] visited the arena during a fight between two [[Gamorrean]]s to get information from Koresh about the whereabouts of other Mandalorians. Koresh attempted to seize the Mandalorian's [[beskar]] [[armor]], but the [[bounty]] [[Hunting|hunter]] defeated the gangster's thugs and chased the Abyssin outside.<ref name="Chapter 9" />

